  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Propaganda; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a circus performance with performers on stage and an audience seated in front. The text overlay reads \"looking for attention? join us,\" which is a sarcastic or ironic invitation to join the spectacle. The overall intent is to promote the event or performance by leveraging the idea that the performers are seeking attention, and the audience is invited to participate in that attention-seeking behavior. This is a form of promotional propaganda designed to attract viewers or attendees to the event. There is no toxicity present in the image, as it does not contain any disparaging metaphors, stereotypes, or harmful content targeting any specific group or individual. The meme is simply using the visual context of a circus to create a humorous or ironic invitation to join the show.",
